# App Icons - Required for PWA and mobile
# Generate these from a 1024x1024 master icon
#
# Required sizes:
# - icon-72.png
# - icon-96.png
# - icon-128.png
# - icon-144.png
# - icon-152.png
# - icon-192.png (PWA required)
# - icon-384.png
# - icon-512.png (PWA required)
# - favicon.ico (16x16, 32x32, 48x48 combined)
# - apple-touch-icon.png (180x180)
